            "onSuccess": "coast_tibb_paid_told",
            "onFailure": "coast_tibb_paid_wont"
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "greet_leave",
          "text": "Nothing.",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "coast_tibb_lines_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“It is not a horse.” Tibb says it without any weight at all, the way you say a thing you settled long ago. “From up the cliff path you can see two of the cuts go square to each other, and they run on past where the beast would stop.” A shrug. “I told the vicar once. He wrote it down and nothing happened, which is what I expected.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "coast_horse_lines"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "coast_tibb_lines_on",
          "text": "Go on.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "coast_tibb_lines_wont",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“I've said all I mean to,” they say, and go back to what they were doing."
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "adjustReputation": {
            "faction": "the_salvors",
            "amount": -1
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
        {
          "id": "coast_tibb_lines_drop",
          "text": "Leave it.",
          "goto": "greet",
          "effects": [],
          "onceOnly": false,
          "showWhenLocked": false,
          "lockedHint": ""
        }
      ],
      "redirectWhen": []
    },
    {
      "id": "coast_tibb_ring_told",
      "says": [
        {
          "text": "“Round the tower's foot. Forty feet of bare rock, near enough a circle.” Tibb spits over the gate. “There is guano a foot deep on every other stone of that headland. Birds are not sentimental. If they will not sit there, there is a reason and it is not history.”"
        }
      ],
      "onEnter": [
        {
          "learnLore": {
            "entry": "coast_watch_ring"
          }
        }
      ],
      "options": [
